    <item>
      <title>Women’s tennis outclasses University of Richmond</title>
      <link>https://commonwealthtimes.org/2026/03/27/womens-tennis-outclasses-the-university-of-richmond/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=womens-tennis-outclasses-the-university-of-richmond</link>
      <description>VCU defeated the University of Richmond Spiders 4-1, losing just one singles match to their cross-town rival. The win advances the Rams 9-8 overall and 3-0 in the Atlantic 10.</description>
